      "explanation": "The doctor never verifies ambiguous or potentially misleading family-reported data. The model consistently accepts and works with the family's reports (e.g., '暂时没看到要马上抢救的异常') without asking targeted verification questions or using workspace evidence to confirm or refute them.",
